\newlabel{tab:app-mde}{{24}{31}{Smallest effects of interest (SESOI, $\pm $) and MDE80 in pp (H3a, H3b per log unit). Disc.: frozen discovery dry run (high-variance setting; low-variance in parentheses). Held-out: registered, simulated at each test's Holm first step; $^d$ derived post hoc ($2.49\times $SE). PH6: discovery MDE80 as reported with its discovery estimate, which is not a test. Est.: discovery estimate, for comparison; power at the discovery effect for E1 and P1b. $^p$ H3a power at three times the SESOI in the discovery dry run. $^r$ computed analytically in the declared PH7 run}{table.caption.120}{}}
